<title>USA: Coca-Cola Enterprises debt offering seen.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola Enterprises debt offering seen.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coca-Cola Enterprises Inc is expected to tap the corporate bond market with a $600-$750 million multi-tranche debt offering, dealers said Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We're hearing that the Coca-Cola deal may include four-, seven- and 10-year tranches,&quot; one syndicate source said.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to come to market as early as next week and will be underwritten by lead manager Lehman Brothers, dealers said.</p>
<p>((--Nancy Leinfuss, corporate bond unit, 212-859-1675))</p>
